<figure class="blueprint">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 760 460" role="img" aria-label="Blueprint sketch: safe and risky borrowers both pay one flat fee of about 1% into the guarantee fund, and the taxpayer covers the shortfall. A chart shows projected exposure to FY30 of Rs 40.36 lakh crore under a flat fee against Rs 25.34 lakh crore under risk-tiered pricing, a gap of Rs 15.02 lakh crore, or 37%." xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
    <defs>
      <pattern id="bp-grid" width="20" height="20" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><path d="M20 0H0V20" fill="none" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-opacity="0.07" stroke-width="1" /></pattern>
      <pattern id="bp-hatch" width="7" height="7" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse" patternTransform="rotate(45)"><line x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="7" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-opacity="0.7" /></pattern>
      <filter id="bp-wob" x="-4%" y="-4%" width="108%" height="108%"><feTurbulence type="fractalNoise" baseFrequency="0.035" numOctaves="2" seed="7" result="n" /><feDisplacementMap in="SourceGraphic" in2="n" scale="3" /></filter>
      <filter id="bp-wob-t" x="-4%" y="-4%" width="108%" height="108%"><feTurbulence type="fractalNoise" baseFrequency="0.05" numOctaves="1" seed="3" result="n" /><feDisplacementMap in="SourceGraphic" in2="n" scale="1.3" /></filter>
      <marker id="bp-arrow" viewBox="0 0 12 12" refX="10" refY="6" markerWidth="15" markerHeight="15" markerUnits="userSpaceOnUse" orient="auto"><path d="M2 2 L10 6 L2 10" fill="none" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" /></marker>
    </defs>
    <rect width="760" height="460" fill="#003366" />
    <rect width="760" height="460" fill="url(#bp-grid)" />
    <g filter="url(#bp-wob)" fill="none" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
      <rect x="24" y="70" width="140" height="56" rx="6" />
      <rect x="24" y="190" width="140" height="56" rx="6" />
      <rect x="214" y="130" width="130" height="56" rx="6" />
      <rect x="204" y="262" width="150" height="56" rx="6" />
      <rect x="194" y="364" width="170" height="56" rx="6" />
      <path d="M166 98 L212 148" marker-end="url(#bp-arrow)" />
      <path d="M166 218 L212 170" marker-end="url(#bp-arrow)" />
      <path d="M279 188 L279 258" marker-end="url(#bp-arrow)" />
      <path d="M279 320 L279 360" marker-end="url(#bp-arrow)" />
      <path d="M420 380 L690 380" />
      <path d="M420 380 L420 86" marker-end="url(#bp-arrow)" />
      <polyline points="440,324 486,305 532,278 578,243 624,195 670,130" />
      <polyline points="440,324 486,311 532,296 578,276 624,252 670,223" stroke-dasharray="2 0" />
      <path d="M560 158 Q 612 170 628 204" marker-end="url(#bp-arrow)" stroke-width="2" />
      <path d="M600 336 L614 288" marker-end="url(#bp-arrow)" stroke-width="2" />
      <path d="M700 177 L700 134" marker-end="url(#bp-arrow)" />
      <path d="M700 177 L700 219" marker-end="url(#bp-arrow)" />
    </g>
    <g filter="url(#bp-wob-t)" class="bp-text">
      <text x="24" y="38" class="l">Fig. 1  Why one flat fee piles up exposure</text>
      <text x="94" y="104" text-anchor="middle" class="m">Safe borrower</text>
      <text x="94" y="224" text-anchor="middle" class="m">Risky borrower</text>
      <text x="279" y="155" text-anchor="middle" class="m">one fee,</text>
      <text x="279" y="177" text-anchor="middle" class="m">about 1%</text>
      <text x="279" y="296" text-anchor="middle" class="m">Guarantee fund</text>
      <text x="279" y="388" text-anchor="middle" class="m">Taxpayer covers</text>
      <text x="279" y="408" text-anchor="middle" class="m">the difference</text>
      <text x="296" y="345" class="s">shortfall</text>
      <text x="432" y="82" class="s">exposure, Rs lakh crore</text>
      <text x="440" y="404" text-anchor="middle" class="s">FY25</text>
      <text x="670" y="404" text-anchor="middle" class="s">FY30</text>
      <text x="446" y="146" class="s">flat fee, 35% a year</text>
      <text x="470" y="352" class="s">risk-tiered, 23% a year</text>
      <text x="670" y="116" text-anchor="middle" class="s b">40.36</text>
      <text x="670" y="248" text-anchor="middle" class="s b">25.34</text>
      <text x="710" y="168" class="s b">gap</text>
      <text x="710" y="188" class="s b">15.02</text>
      <text x="710" y="208" class="s b">(37%)</text>
    </g>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>Blueprint: how a flat fee accumulates exposure, with the FY25 to FY30 projection from the model.</figcaption>
</figure>
